  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Electricity Distribution System Improvements Project, through Continuum Associates, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for ECOF Kaduna Limited, a privately-owned company in Nigeria, to develop 2.5 megawatts (MW) of solar photovoltaic energy, procure 30 MW of hydroelectricity, and improve electricity transmission and distribution to service residential, commercial and industrial customers within the Kaduna Electric Company distribution territory in Kaduna (Project). When implemented, the Project will provide critical reliable and affordable energy to the people of Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
